  "answer_text": "Because of differing episode orders (production order vs. regional airing orders) used by different broadcasters, \"Season 2, Episode 12\" can refer to one of two episodes\u2014both of which have already been released:\n\n1. **\"Sapotis\"** (Episode 12 in production order):\n   * **Release Date:** **January 21, 2018** (First aired on TF1 in France). \n   * **Description:** In this episode, Alya's twin sisters are akumatized into multiplying monsters, and Alya is temporarily given the Fox Miraculous to become Rena Rouge.\n\n2. **\"Captain Hardrock\"** (Episode 12 in the broadcast order of several networks, including Netflix US):\n   * **Release Date:** **March 30, 2018** (First aired on Netflix US and Family Channel in Canada).\n   * **Description:** In this episode, Juleka's mother is akumatized into a pirate captain aboard a ship, and Luka Couffaine is introduced.\n\n***\n\n**Did you mean Season 6?**\nIf you meant the newer season, **Season 6, Episode 12** (\"Wreckless Driver\") has also already been released, premiering on **October 12, 2025**.",
